HISTORY the ithaperture in order j can be found as                              HISTORY follows:lambda=array[*,0,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                         HISTORY (i-1)],flux=array[*,1,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                            HISTORY (i-1)],uncertainty=array[*,2,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                     HISTORY (i-1)],flag=array[*,3,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)].The spectra         HISTORY in the file(s) spectra0057.fits,                                        HISTORY spectra0058.fits,spectra0059.fits, spectra0060.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0061.fits,spectra0062.fits, spectra0063.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0064.fits,spectra0065.fits, spectra0066.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0067.fits,spectra0068.fits, spectra0069.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0070.fits,spectra0071.fits, spectra0072.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0073.fits,spectra0074.fits, spectra0075.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0076.fits werecombined using a robust weighted mean with         HISTORY a sigma threshold of8.  Aperture 1 modifications: The scale             HISTORY factors were determinedusing order 1 and are:                           HISTORY 1.2665059615052028, 0.7801635820536286,0.8165199402567432,              HISTORY 0.9765755673244602, 0.8078174451857272,1.0229810798246097,              HISTORY 0.8616670794095447, 1.5387804515554313,1.335968166544474,               HISTORY 1.47954045244623, 0.7567085888670679,0.7151931138909311,                HISTORY 0.6379260862702653, 0.9780287655603939,0.8462902650197694,              HISTORY 1.2947206035167234, 1.0643560764449436,1.4565013713146033,              HISTORY 1.1344407653896447, 1.3324793698159665.                                 END                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             